OL,3,GNEWSAHollywood actor Luke Evans on
OL,4,A'joyous' four months filming in rainy
OL,5,AWales
OL,6,
OL,7,FHollywood actor Luke Evans said filming
OL,8,Fjust 25 minutes from his childhood home
OL,9,Fwas "joyous" - and some family members
OL,10,Feven made a cameo in the final episode
OL,11,Fof his new drama.
OL,13,FThe Pontypool-born star, who is also an
OL,14,Fexecutive producer of the five-part
OL,15,Fseries, The Party, came up with the
OL,16,Fidea to adapt the acclaimed novel by
OL,17,FElizabeth Day into a drama for the
OL,18,Fscreen.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,436,430,260,140,0,100
