OL,3,GNEWSAHollywood actor Luke Evans on
OL,4,A'joyous' four months filming in rainy
OL,5,AWales
OL,6,
OL,7,FFor the first time in 30 years, Evans
OL,8,Fwas able to film close to Aberbargoed,
OL,9,FCaerphilly county, where he grew up, as
OL,10,Fthe drama was shot in Cardiff and
OL,11,FBridgend.
OL,13,FThe star of Beauty and the Beast,
OL,14,FImmortals and The Hobbit had been used
OL,15,Fto being far from home while working on
OL,16,Fthe stage and films.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
